	myDescription "branch = \"\", contextComment = \"Desc of Lore_Planet_AKI_Location_10\", enabled = true, guid = #D00CF65464E371CE00011080D5E14F39, lineVersion = 38, maxLength = 50, productId = 6, sectionId = 9957, text = \"The Pyke Syndicate holds a sizable district in Myrra, staying in the satrapy's good graces by paying exuberant taxes for the land. While the satrapy claims to be strictly opposed to any form of organized crime, the Pykes have managed to bribe and coerce most influential representatives to stay almost untouchable.\", type = \"MenuLine\"}"
